          "text": "Freshness cannot be judged solely by whether a flower comes from a major market. Milan's flower market, the trading channels of Aalsmeer and flower production on the Sanremo Riviera are different parts of the supply chain. Ask about the batch actually available and the characteristics of the variety. Checking petals, leaves and stems is more useful than assuming a harvest date from appearance alone. For an uncommon variety or a specific country of origin, request confirmation before finalising the arrangement and allow for an alternative if unavailable."
